<title>UK: Novorossiisk still shut due bad weather - shipper.</title>
<headline>Novorossiisk still shut due bad weather - shipper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Black Sea crude export terminal of Novorossiisk stayed shut on Tuesday morning, having closed on Sunday night due to bad weather, a shipping inspector said.</p>
<p>The weather forecast for Tuesday was for winds up to Force 9 and up to 1.5 metres of swell.</p>
<p>In addition, Novorossiisk's largest berth, number one, was shut for maintenance as scheduled until Dec 24.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
